<title>JAPAN: NTT shares jump on solid half-year profit.</title>
<headline>NTT shares jump on solid half-year profit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp (NTT) jumped on Friday, helped by the company's better-than-expected half-year earnings which were announced earlier in the afternoon, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price gained 22,000 yen to 801,000 yen by 0527 GMT, on volume of 9,038 shares.  </p>
<p>The giant telecommunications company announced on Friday afternoon that its parent current profit for the six months to September 30, 1996, soared to 207.75 billion yen from 126.78 billion yen a year earlier.</p>
